privacy+='''<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="policy-text"><p class="note-banner"><strong>Important:</strong> This page describes the behaviour of this reconstructed GitHub Pages website. It is not a substitute for QBranch’s formal legal privacy policy, which should be supplied or approved by the company before a production domain migration.</p><h2>Contacting QBranch</h2><p>When you use the enquiry form, your browser prepares an email containing the details you entered. You decide whether to send it using your email service. This website itself does not upload, retain or process the form contents on a server. You can alternatively call or email QBranch directly.</p><h2>Information sent by email</h2><p>If you send an email to a QBranch address, it is delivered through your email provider and handled through the recipient’s email systems. Please avoid sharing passwords, banking credentials or sensitive personal information in ordinary enquiry emails.</p><h2>Third-party resources</h2><p>The website may request fonts from Google Fonts and illustrative photos from Unsplash. External map links open Google Maps. These providers may process connection information under their own policies.</p><h2>Cookies and analytics</h2><p>This website does not intentionally set tracking cookies and does not include an analytics tracker at launch.</p><h2>Contact information</h2><p>For questions about the website or enquiries, contact <a href="mailto:info@qbranch.co.ug" style="color:var(--blue)">info@qbranch.co.ug</a> or use the information on the <a href="contact.html" style="color:var(--blue)">Contact page</a>.</p><p style="font-size:.77rem">Last website update: 22 November 2026</p></div></div></section>'''

